{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道行动还不够，却舍不得松手，那一步曾救他走出犹豫，承认失望仿佛就要推翻它。\",\n      \"key\": \"救他走出犹豫\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"text\": \"想到那种不必防备的亲近，他心里会软，却怕一松劲又停了步。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里会软\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他把难受和想停都当成自己还不够坚定，便逼自己继续撑。\",\n      \"key\": \"不够坚定\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"text\": \"这股劲曾撑起他，如今他一累就怪自己。他发现自己正逼着一个累了的人硬撑，不想再证明自己多坚强。\",\n      \"key\": \"一累就怪自己\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他有些茫然，逼自己硬撑的劲松了，心里却没安心，才肯承认自己舍不得那种不必防备的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"不必防备的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并补明\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动明明不够却舍不得松手，补回那一步曾救他走出犹豫的真实经历。把抽象的怕失望说明变心，改成承认失望仿佛要推翻曾经的决定。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把痛苦误认成迟疑、把想停误认成不够坚定的心理机制。删去怕辜负最初决意的重复表述，松手的顾虑已由S05-1说明。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R20\", \"R21\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"找回那股曾让他昂起头的劲，后来连疲惫也容不下，逐渐变成责怪自己的要求。保留他发现自己正在逼一个累了的人硬撑，以及不想再证明坚强的转变。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R22\", \"R23\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留催逼松开却没有安心、被压住的依恋终于浮现这两个心理事实。将抽象的舍不得具体落在前文已经出现的不必防备的亲近上，使下一段对生活的向往有真实的心理来处。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并承接前段\",\n      \"why\": \"补足开头柔和亲近的心理原因：他确实体验过那种亲近，所以想到它会心软；但此前停下行动的恐惧仍在限制他。解释柔软与克制为何同时存在。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "34aed02c-a56b-4d7d-b817-22e01a8c8ba7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T001115617354Z", "elapsed_seconds": 122.063, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:13:17.681742+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "06962b95e7646b58b25f768cb21341af414c8dd7868a199a354f7cae688ad61d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33